01:20:37,500 --> 01:20:43,500
World Trade Center is a 2006 American docudrama disaster film
directed by Oliver Stone and written by Andrea Berloff.

11
01:28:41,250 --> 01:28:47,250
Starring Nicolas Cage and Michael Peña, the film is based on the experience of a team of Port Authority Police Officers during
the September 11 attacks, in which they were trapped inside the rubble of the collapsed World Trade Center.

12
01:36:45,000 --> 01:36:51,000
The film was shot between October 2005 and February 2006, and theatrically
released in the United States by Paramount Pictures on August 9, 2006.

13
01:44:48,750 --> 01:44:54,750
It was met with generally positive reviews from
critics and grossed $163 million worldwide.

14
01:52:52,500 --> 01:52:58,500
The film explores themes of rescue, hero, alarm clock, war on terror, runaway.

15
